# Domain repositories

Layout: `domain/repositories/<entity>/`. Ports only — Prisma impl in infrastructure.

## Port shape

```ts
export const X_REPOSITORY_TOKEN = Symbol('X_REPOSITORY_TOKEN');

export type IXRepository = IReadRepository<IPublic, string, IRelations> &
  ICreateRepository<IEntity, ICreateInput> &
  IUpdateRepository<IEntity, string, IUpdateInput> &
  ISoftDeleteRepository<IEntity, string> & {
    findEntityById(id: string, scope?: TransactionScope): Promise<IEntity | null>;
  };
```

- Prefer **type intersection** of `@shared/domain/repositories` capability ports
- One repository per aggregate (read + write together)
- Write methods require `TransactionScope`
- Auth-only without list: flat port without `IReadRepository`

## Do not

- Import Prisma / Nest / presentation
- Fat god CRUD interface instead of ISP
- Split read/write into two repositories for the same aggregate
- Use `PrismaCrudRepository`
